SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50 charge

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50 charge

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

USE solution 1
USE equilibrium_phases 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -solution 1
    -totals C(4) Ca
END